{"id":"n15598-2-9","stage":3,"title":"손길 · 援手","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15598-2-9-1","ko":"저는 어릴 적부터 부모님과 떨어져서 할머니와 살았습니다.","zh":"我从小就与父母分开，和奶奶一起生活。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어릴","meaning":"年轻","explanation":"어리다：年轻；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적부터","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"적：时，时候；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71232","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부모님과","meaning":"父母","explanation":"부모님：父母；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"부모님","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62272","senseId":"1","lemma":"부모님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어져서","meaning":"分开，分离","explanation":"떨어지다：分开，分离；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"13","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할머니와","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살았습니다.","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年轻","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"068bccdcf866defe","term":"부모님","zh":"父母","audio":"/audio/068bccdcf866defe1ca7.mp3","entryId":"62272","definition":"(敬语)父亲和母亲。","pronunciation":["부모님"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"分开，分离","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"断绝关系或分开过。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6823b74b46cab9872a28.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15598-2-9-2","ko":"어머니의 손길이 몹시 그리웠겠군요.","zh":"您一定非常想念母亲的关怀吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"妈妈，母亲","explanation":"어머니：妈妈，母亲；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"5","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손길이","meaning":"援手，魔爪","explanation":"손길：援手，魔爪；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손길","audio":"/audio/c350edd85add741279b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15598","senseId":"2","lemma":"손길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몹시","meaning":"十分，非常，太","explanation":"몹시：十分，非常，太","readings":[{"term":"몹시","audio":"/audio/99b538e623b7d3e4ec77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54767","senseId":"1","lemma":"몹시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그리웠겠군요.","meaning":"思念，怀念","explanation":"그립다：思念，怀念；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군요：对新发现或新理解的情况表示礼貌的感叹。","readings":[{"term":"그립다","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37070","senseId":"1","lemma":"그립다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"妈妈，母亲","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"(喻义)像对待子女一样关爱、爱护和牵挂自己的人或那样的存在。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"c350edd85add7412","term":"손길","zh":"援手，魔爪","audio":"/audio/c350edd85add741279b3.mp3","entryId":"15598","definition":"(喻义)帮助或祸害别人之事。","pronunciation":["손낄"]},{"id":"99b538e623b7d3e4","term":"몹시","zh":"十分，非常，太","audio":"/audio/99b538e623b7d3e4ec77.mp3","entryId":"54767","definition":"程度很深地。","pronunciation":["몹ː씨"]},{"id":"b0dcbd20216264fb","term":"그립다","zh":"思念，怀念","audio":"/audio/b0dcbd20216264fb84be.mp3","entryId":"37070","definition":"非常想念，想见面。","pronunciation":["그립따"]}],"audio":"/audio/89455690501c9fe9a4a6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.809,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15598","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6357,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["您一定非常想念母亲的关怀吧。","今天的会议是怎么结束的？","我从小就与父母分开，和奶奶一起生活。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您一定非常想念母亲的关怀吧。","我从小就与父母分开，和奶奶一起生活。","今天的会议是怎么结束的？"],"answer":0}]}
